Tool response:
Tool: update_patient_contact_info
Description: Update the contact preference and phone number for a specific patient identified by patient ID.
Only allows updating to valid contact preference values: Phone, Email, SMS, Mail.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "patient_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Internal ID of the patient to update",
          "title": "Patient Id"
        },
        "phone": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Phone"
        },
        "contact_preference": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "Phone",
                "Email",
                "SMS",
                "Mail"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Contact Preference"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "patient_id"
      ]
    }
